Package: claude-wg-peer
Version: 0.1.3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: wireguard-tools, nftables, iproute2, procps, systemd
Maintainer: Claude peer owner
Description: Protected WireGuard peer contract for the Claude WSL egress
 This package owns the Claude-specific systemd drop-in, forwarding service,
 scoped nftables policy, and read-only validation commands around the
 distribution-provided wg-quick implementation. It does not replace
 wireguard-tools, NetworkManager, or the live peer configuration.
